      "en": "Now the rest of the acts of Joash, and all that he did, and his might with which he fought against Amaziah king of Judah, aren’t they written in the book of the chronicles of the kings of Israel?",
      "ko": "요아스의 남은 사적과 무릇 행한 일과 유다 왕 아마샤와 싸운 권력은 이스라엘 왕 역대지략에 기록되지 아니하였느냐",
      "source_text_hash": "74bd33fe012abf51de4e7c73213c3c65700718546c59b098424fcd68938a97d8",
      "translation_text_hash": "59918fad8f921f53019a02aede6da73b089cf9645f56fc7bbf2e3152deb8eacf",
