      "en": "He said, “Take the arrows;” and he took them. He said to the king of Israel, “Strike the ground;” and he struck three times, and stopped.",
      "ko": "또 가로되 살들을 취하소서 곧 취하매 엘리사가 또 이스라엘 왕에게 이르되 땅을 치소서 이에 세번 치고 그친지라",
      "source_text_hash": "ac4c4c76533553a4ba6698bfc6b54c896706c47482e9f066b8c8794c50e3442a",
